l":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-21T13:45:58Z","updated_at":"2025-03-21T13:45:58Z","body":"Not that I am aware of, the demand is very low and I think the solution is pretty complicated to implement","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2743415323/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2777514904","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104408#issuecomment-2777514904","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104408","id":2777514904,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ljYOY","user":{"login":"theludovyc","id":7337158,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczMzcxNTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7337158?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/theludovyc","html_url":"https://github.com/theludovyc","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theludovyc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theludovyc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theludovyc/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theludovyc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theludovyc/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theludovyc/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theludovyc/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theludovyc/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theludovyc/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-04T04:14:12Z","updated_at":"2025-04-04T04:14:12Z","body":"> > I'm talking about that this needs compatibility methods/binds which aren't implemented for these areas yet\n> \n> Understood, thanks. Is there any ongoing effort to solve this, or at least an Issue tracking it?\n\nI do not understand what it is not implemented yet, and why it will only work with gdscript. Can you explain for me with more details please 😊","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2777514904/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2777719833","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104408#issuecomment-2777719833","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104408","id":2777719833,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6lkKQZ","user":{"login":"Bromeon","id":708488,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwODQ4OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/708488?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bromeon","html_url":"https://github.com/Bromeon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bromeon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bromeon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bromeon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bromeon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bromeon/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bromeon/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bromeon/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bromeon/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bromeon/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-04T06:59:41Z","updated_at":"2025-04-04T06:59:41Z","body":"> I do not understand what it is not implemented yet, and why it will only work with gdscript. Can you explain for me with more details please 😊\r\n\r\nIn a nutshell:\r\n- GDExtension uses C function pointers to dispatch all calls to the engine. These have a fixed signature (types and number of parameters).\r\n- GDExtension needs to retain _binary_ compatibility. This means that an extension compiled in Godot 4.1 still works when running in an engine version 4.4.\r\n- GDScript on the other hand just needs _source_ compatibility. It also supports default parameters, being more flexible with such changes.\r\n- Changing the signature of a C function pointer (by adding a new parameter) **breaks** compatibility. The Godot 4.1 extension (which doesn't have that extra parameter yet) will run into undefined behavior when dispatching the pointer that now points to a different function.\r\n- To mitigate this, a system called \"compatibility methods\" has been implemented **for class methods**. This means the engine would provide two methods, one with the old and one with the new signature, and the old one would transparently call the new one. This retains compatibility from GDExtension side.\r\n- Such a system has not been implemented **for utility methods** (like `is_equal_approx`), and doing so is non-trivial for limited benefit.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2777719833/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2780550434","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104408#issuecomment-2780550434","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104408","id":2780550434,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6lu9Ui","user":{"login":"theludovyc","id":7337158,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczMzcxNTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7337158?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/theludovyc","html_url":"https://github.com/theludovyc","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theludovyc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theludovyc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theludovyc/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theludovyc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theludovyc/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theludovyc/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theludovyc/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theludovyc/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theludovyc/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-05T08:09:06Z","updated_at":"2025-04-05T08:09:06Z","body":"@Bromeon Thanks for your detailed answer 😊\n\nDoes it difficult to implement the \"compatibility methods\" system ?\n\nIt it is, is this why you say the benefit is low ?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2780550434/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2781034207","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104408#issuecomment-2781034207","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104408","id":2781034207,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6lwzbf","user":{"login":"Dowsley","id":22419861,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNDE5ODYx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22419861?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dowsley","html_url":"https://github.com/Dowsley","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dowsley/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dowsley/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dowsley/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dowsley/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dowsley/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dowsley/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dowsley/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dowsley/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dowsley/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-05T18:33:47Z","updated_at":"2025-04-05T18:34:09Z","body":"> @Bromeon Thanks for your detailed answer 😊\n> \n> Does it difficult to implement the \"compatibility methods\" system ?\n> \n> It it is, is this why you say the benefit is low ?\n\nIt is non-trivial, meaning the amount of effort required to implement and review is of enough size for people to start asking what are the benefits. Which are not a lot, apparently.\n\nThat doesn't mean it's not doable though.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2781034207/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]